  {
    "_id": "8f62b1f0f7ce04f4",
    "name": "Blacksmithing Materials",
    "pages": [
      {
        "_id": "d0a0f6bc39be9f16",
        "name": "Blacksmithing Materials",
        "type": "text",
        "title": {
          "show": true,
          "level": 1
        },
        "text": {
          "format": 1,
          "content": "<p>Weapon: The stat bonuses go to Focus and Power. With getting a +1 bonus or a +2/+1 bonus, the crafter may choose which of the two stats gets the extra bonus.</p><p>Tool: For tools, there is a crafting bonus and a finish bonus. A crafting bonus gives you +1 (or +2) to each crafting dice roll. The finish bonus gives you a +5 (or +10) bonus once at the end of your craft.</p><p>For Tools that function as weapons you have to choose between a stat bonus OR the crafting bonus, you do not get both.</p><hr><p><small>Source: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1S7ygwpW8p6rqOjf7bfmfylhzx9R3uFfP3ZYBFGlDeLs/edit#gid=286625673\">Flo's Madness</a>. Prices ending in c are Clim; amounts ending in u are units.</small></p>"
        },
        "flags": {
          "lyrian-chronicles": {
            "seedKey": "flos-madness:crafting-guide--blacksmithing-materials",
            "stableId": "crafting-guide--blacksmithing-materials",
            "sourceUrl": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1S7ygwpW8p6rqOjf7bfmfylhzx9R3uFfP3ZYBFGlDeLs/edit#gid=286625673",
            "sourceHash": "343dc1544b556d881c46a0bd876a88eaf29b5fbf23bb457d4baee8eb0619edd2",
            "rulebookVersion": "Flo's Madness",
            "contentBuild": "0.6.0"
          }
        }
