  {
    "_id": "a7e66d95f4d5f7b9",
    "name": "Culinarian Materials",
    "pages": [
      {
        "_id": "e75b6213927cf284",
        "name": "Culinarian Materials",
        "type": "text",
        "title": {
          "show": true,
          "level": 1
        },
        "text": {
          "format": 1,
          "content": "<p>The base material for crafting food is Food Units.  These units can be any kind of food/filler material, for example:</p><p>400u of Flour<br>200u of Fish<br>400u of Noodles</p><p>This is enough food to make 25 Pemmican [Rations] (1000u of any combination of food)</p><p>200u of Flour<br>100u of Fish<br>200u of Noodles</p><p>This is enough food to make a Gourmet Stock (500u of any combination of food)</p><p>When crafting a stock, you make 10 at a time. When making a box for stocks it&#39;s 1 per 500u.</p><hr><p><small>Source: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1S7ygwpW8p6rqOjf7bfmfylhzx9R3uFfP3ZYBFGlDeLs/edit#gid=2073204002\">Flo's Madness</a>. Prices ending in c are Clim; amounts ending in u are units.</small></p>"
        },
        "flags": {
          "lyrian-chronicles": {
            "seedKey": "flos-madness:crafting-guide--culinarian-materials",
            "stableId": "crafting-guide--culinarian-materials",
            "sourceUrl": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1S7ygwpW8p6rqOjf7bfmfylhzx9R3uFfP3ZYBFGlDeLs/edit#gid=2073204002",
            "sourceHash": "acc911b6697f0e88b1eca7dfcdd0208f0038017e36ed3f758584387159c74cc0",
            "rulebookVersion": "Flo's Madness",
            "contentBuild": "0.6.0"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
