  {
    "_id": "919fedcf8b56f705",
    "name": "Farming Materials",
    "pages": [
      {
        "_id": "df48c9b4b8db1779",
        "name": "Farming Materials",
        "type": "text",
        "title": {
          "show": true,
          "level": 1
        },
        "text": {
          "format": 1,
          "content": "<p>Cost is the value of the seed.</p><p>Difficulty is how much crafting points it takes to gather the yield when harvesting.</p><p>Yield is what the seed gives once harvested.</p><p>Growing time is how long a seed takes to be harvested. A growing time of 1 means it can be harvested immediately once you have enough IP to use the Harvest ability. When a seed has a growing time longer than 1, it takes harvests equal to the growing time to receive the yield. When resolving a harvest with a seed with a growing time of more than 1 remaining, you still need to pay the difficulty to take care of the seed like normal.</p><p>Special: [Moon-Phase Seeds Only] If you let it grow for another season after the first, the yield changes to a Mystic Herb of the same element.</p><p>Fertilizer can be applied during the sowing part. You can only apply 1 fertilizer at the same time.</p><hr><p><small>Source: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1S7ygwpW8p6rqOjf7bfmfylhzx9R3uFfP3ZYBFGlDeLs/edit#gid=1231598790\">Flo's Madness</a>. Prices ending in c are Clim; amounts ending in u are units.</small></p>"
        },
        "flags": {
          "lyrian-chronicles": {
            "seedKey": "flos-madness:crafting-guide--farming-materials",
            "stableId": "crafting-guide--farming-materials",
            "sourceUrl": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1S7ygwpW8p6rqOjf7bfmfylhzx9R3uFfP3ZYBFGlDeLs/edit#gid=1231598790",
            "sourceHash": "6d653b6d3afbc9222bdacb5d183d62f5350723bc4174d8db8081cd09a67bd1c4",
            "rulebookVersion": "Flo's Madness",
            "contentBuild": "0.6.0"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
