  {
    "_id": "2380b426a70d1105",
    "name": "Armor Mods",
    "pages": [
      {
        "_id": "37b253cdfe544714",
        "name": "Armor Mods",
        "type": "text",
        "title": {
          "show": true,
          "level": 1
        },
        "text": {
          "format": 1,
          "content": "<p>These are mods that can be put on any armor (not shield), regardless of type.</p><p>Frame Mods</p><p>Flamellon mods are special mods that can be put on armors. To put one of these mods on an item you must have sufficient items with the matching Flamelic Polarity.</p><p>Adding a layering of the required element automatically fulfills/gives polarity equal to the units in the ingot. For example, adding a Salachar ingot as layering also gives you 3000 Salachar polarity.</p><hr><p><small>Source: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1S7ygwpW8p6rqOjf7bfmfylhzx9R3uFfP3ZYBFGlDeLs/edit#gid=36846504\">Flo's Madness</a>. Prices ending in c are Clim; amounts ending in u are units.</small></p>"
        },
        "flags": {
          "lyrian-chronicles": {
            "seedKey": "flos-madness:crafting-guide--armor-mods",
            "stableId": "crafting-guide--armor-mods",
            "sourceUrl": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1S7ygwpW8p6rqOjf7bfmfylhzx9R3uFfP3ZYBFGlDeLs/edit#gid=36846504",
            "sourceHash": "82931a25e3946eda4586adc6934e8743377870315eed3c8215d1255b3dde05ee",
            "rulebookVersion": "Flo's Madness",
            "contentBuild": "0.6.0"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
