  {
    "_id": "b1669d6dd5401346",
    "name": "Weapon Mods",
    "pages": [
      {
        "_id": "5fca98faad3b7b2f",
        "name": "Weapon Mods",
        "type": "text",
        "title": {
          "show": true,
          "level": 1
        },
        "text": {
          "format": 1,
          "content": "<p>These are mods that can be put on any weapon, regardless of type.<br>While gathering is a universal mod, you still cannot gather unless the weapon is a tool that can be used for gathering.</p><p>Alloy mods can also be put on any weapon, but require the weapon to include a specific type of alloy. If the weapon does not include this alloy, the mod cannot be used.</p><hr><p><small>Source: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1S7ygwpW8p6rqOjf7bfmfylhzx9R3uFfP3ZYBFGlDeLs/edit#gid=97476896\">Flo's Madness</a>. Prices ending in c are Clim; amounts ending in u are units.</small></p>"
        },
